### Get status of crypto updates = remaining tasks
GET {{origin}}/admin/realms/encrypted-realm/crypto-update
Authorization: Bearer {{$auth.token("keycloak-admin-auth")}}

### Clear remaining crypto updates; active ones will still finish
DELETE {{origin}}/admin/realms/encrypted-realm/crypto-update
Authorization: Bearer {{$auth.token("keycloak-admin-auth")}}

### Start a crypto update for all entities
POST {{origin}}/admin/realms/encrypted-realm/crypto-update
Authorization: Bearer {{$auth.token("keycloak-admin-auth")}}
